        "button_text": "Our Story",
        "add_right_arrow": true,
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/our-story",
        "paragraph": "Founded by Tj Kolesnik in 2023, Make Waves Agency is where culture, creativity, and commerce converge. We partner with brands to build legacies through content production, brand strategy, retention, and web design; the four pillars that define digital success.<br><br>\n\nIt all starts with content, the heart of every brand’s identity. Through high-impact storytelling, elevated visuals, and scroll-stopping campaigns, we craft narratives that cut through the noise. But compelling content alone isn’t enough. Brand strategy is what transforms vision into impact, ensuring every creative touchpoint aligns with a brand’s core identity and long-term goals.<br><br>\n\nAcquisition is just the beginning. Our retention strategies turn first-time buyers into lifelong brand advocates, leveraging email, SMS, and personalized experiences to drive loyalty and maximize customer lifetime value.<br><br>\n\nBehind every seamless brand experience is web design that not only looks beautiful but converts, built with precision, optimized for performance, and designed for growth.<br><br>\n\nFrom AG1, YZY, BLYT Basics, Neiman Marcus, Hugo Boss, Honda, True Classic, Huega House and beyond, we’ve launched brands into culture, scaled them into category leaders, and redefined how they engage with their audiences.<br><br>\n\nAt Make Waves, we don’t just follow trends, we create them. Because brands that make an impact don’t just make noise, they make waves.<br><br>",
